@vdemeester created the calendar event (so he can record it!) and we
found a time that works well for CEST, IST and CST. It's possible for
EST to attend but pretty early. Probably not reasonable for PST. Anyway
we want to start alternating our meeting time so that folks in Asia can
attend if they want to.

@vdemeester @afrittoli

@sbose78 is helping review PRs in pipeline repo and has committed a few changes to trigger repo.

* https://github.com/search?q=org%3Atektoncd+is%3Apr+author%3Asbose78
* https://github.com/tektoncd/pipeline/pull/3787

We have a number of projects in-flight that refer to or directly use repository information. It might be a good idea to try and introduce a single place for configuration of this kind of info to avoid a situation where users / operators have to individually configure multiple different components with the same repo information.

This commit adds a problem statement and use-cases for a repo CRD to try and address this potential issue.

@dibyom @sm43 @chmouel would you like to be included as authors on this TEP? I kept your names off for now so that you could act as reviewers instead 👼 but more than happy to include your names here if you're interested!

Add adambkaplan (me!) to the Tekton GitHub organization. @dibyom and
@vdemeester have nominated me to be an approver for Results.

Signed-off-by: Adam Kaplan <adam@adambkaplan.com>

@jerop has been filling in for @bobcatfish in the governing board while she was on leave, see the [leave policy][leave-policy]

@bobcatfish is back 🎉🎉🎉

this change removes @jerop and adds @bobcatfish to the governing board

[leave-policy]: https://github.com/tektoncd/community/blob/main/governance.md#governing-board-leave-policy

@jisoolee has contributed 3 PRs to tektoncd/dashboard, is working on a fourth one, and will continue to contribute to Tekton on a regular basis.

I endorse @jisoolee to join the Tekton org:
https://github.com/tektoncd/community/blob/936bdafeebc8392b1a44012630435c2218f2db05/process/contributor-ladder.md#organization-member

Avinal has been reviewing and raising PRs for results. Let's add him to the results collaborator and 
maintainer.

